# The language's vocabulary, one word per line.
# Marathi (Devanagari) vocabulary, one word per line.
# No GPL-3.0-compatible Hunspell dictionary exists for mr: wooorm/dictionaries
# ships none, and LibreOffice's mr_IN is GPL-2.0-only (bare COPYING, no 'or
# later' grant) so it cannot be copied into this GPL-3.0-or-later repo. Built
# instead the way hi/word.lst was: every token of the other mr files, both
# halves of misspelling.lst included, plus hand-authored common vocabulary.
-
